# macOS-only entries.
#
# macOS currently needs no diverging versions of the shared files:
# everything host-specific lives in config/fish/conf.d/local.fish
# or in files excluded from this repository (opencode, zed, nvim).
#
# If a file really must differ between macOS and Linux, put the macOS
# variant in overrides/darwin/config/<path> and list it here.
